            </div>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- 메인 컨텐츠 시작 (헤더 높이만큼 패딩 추가) -->
    <div style="padding-top: 80px;"></div>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Repost</h1>
            <p class="tagline">블로그 댓글 자동 추천, 읽은 척은 이제 그만<br>AI가 진짜 읽고 자연스러운 댓글을 만들어드립니다</p>
            <p class="subtitle">블로그 네트워킹의 시간을 90% 줄이는 AI 비서</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 🎨 블로거 도구 섹션 (NEW!) -->
        <div class="blogger-tools-section">
            <div class="tools-header">
                <h2>🛠️ 블로거 필수 도구</h2>
                <p>글쓰기부터 SEO까지, 블로거가 필요한 모든 도구를 한 곳에</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tools-grid">
                <a href="/tools/text-analyzer" class="tool-card">
                    <div class="tool-icon">📊</div>
                    <h3>텍스트 분석기</h3>
                    <p>키워드 밀도, 글자수, 가독성을 실시간으로 분석</p>
                    <div class="tool-badge">무료</div>
                </a>
                <a href="/tools/title-generator" class="tool-card">
                    <div class="tool-icon">💡</div>
                    <h3>제목 생성기</h3>
                    <p>AI가 클릭율 높은 제목 10개를 즉시 생성</p>
                    <div class="tool-badge">인기</div>
                </a>
                <a href="/tools/seo-checker" class="tool-card">
                    <div class="tool-icon">🎯</div>
                    <h3>SEO 점수 체커</h3>
                    <p>검색 최적화 점수와 개선 방법을 자동 분석</p>
                    <div class="tool-badge">NEW</div>
                </a>
                <a href="/tools/ai-writer" class="tool-card">
                    <div class="tool-icon">✍️</div>
                    <h3>AI 글쓰기 도우미</h3>
                    <p>주제만 입력하면 AI가 블로그 초안을 자동 작성</p>
                    <div class="tool-badge">PRO</div>
                </a>
                <a href="/tools/competitor-analyzer" class="tool-card">
                    <div class="tool-icon">🔍</div>
                    <h3>경쟁 블로그 분석</h3>
                    <p>상위 블로그를 분석하여 개선 방법 제시</p>
                    <div class="tool-badge">PRO</div>
                </a>
                <a href="/tools/keyword-recommender" class="tool-card">
                    <div class="tool-icon">🔑</div>
                    <h3>키워드 추천</h3>
                    <p>검색량과 난이도 기반 최적 키워드 추천</p>
                    <div class="tool-badge">PRO</div>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 하얀 배경 컨텐츠 영역 -->
        <div class="content-wrapper">
            <div class="input-section">
                <div class="input-group">
                    <input 
                        type="text" 
                        id="blogUrl" 
                        placeholder="네이버 블로그 URL을 입력하세요 (예: https://blog.naver.com/...)"
                    >
                    <button onclick="resetInput()" id="resetBtn" class="reset-btn" title="입력란 초기화">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="width: 24px; height: 24px; color: #1a1a2e;">
                            <path d="M21.5 2v6h-6M2.5 22v-6h6M2 11.5a10 10 0 0 1 18.8-4.3M22 12.5a10 10 0 0 1-18.8 4.2"/>
                        </svg>
                    </button>
                    <button onclick="analyzeBlog()" id="analyzeBtn">
                        분석하기
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3가지 강점 -->
            <div class="features">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon">⚡</span>
                    <div class="feature-title">3초면 충분</div>
                    <div class="feature-desc">URL만 붙여넣으면<br>AI가 알아서 분석</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon">🎯</span>
                    <div class="feature-title">진짜처럼</div>
                    <div class="feature-desc">블로그 내용 읽고<br>맞춤 댓글 8개</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <span class="feature-icon">💯</span>
                    <div class="feature-title">완벽한 UX</div>
                    <div class="feature-desc">복사→이동→댓글<br>원스톱으로 끝!</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="error" id="errorMsg"></div>

            <div class="loading" id="loading">
                <div class="loading-animation">
                    <div class="cute-robot">🤖</div>
                    <div class="thinking-dots">
                        <span>💭</span>
                        <span>✨</span>
                        <span>📝</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="loading-progress">
                    <div class="progress-bar" id="progressBar"></div>
                </div>
                <p class="loading-step" id="loadingStep">블로그 내용을 읽고 있어요...</p>
                <p class="loading-tip" id="loadingTip">💡 댓글을 복사한 후 바로 블로그로 이동할 수 있어요!</p>
            </div>

            <div class="blog-info" id="blogInfo">
                <h3 id="blogTitle"></h3>
                <p id="blogContent"></p>
            </div>

            <button class="go-to-blog-btn" id="goToBlogBtn" onclick="goToBlog()">
                📝 블로그로 이동하여 댓글 달기 <span>→</span>
            </button>

            <div class="comments-section" id="commentsSection">
                <div class="comments-header">💬 추천 댓글</div>
                <div id="commentsList"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 💬 Quick 피드백 위젯 -->
    <div id="feedbackWidget" class="feedback-widget">
        <button class="feedback-close" onclick="closeFeedbackWidget()" aria-label="닫기">✕</button>
        <div id="feedbackMessage">
            <div class="feedback-header">
                <div class="feedback-icon">💝</div>
                <h3 class="feedback-title">Repost가 도움이 되셨나요?</h3>
                <p class="feedback-subtitle">솔직한 의견을 들려주세요</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feedback-buttons">
                <button class="feedback-btn" onclick="submitQuickFeedback(5)" data-rating="5">
                    <span class="emoji">😍</span>
                    <span class="label">최고예요</span>
                </button>
                <button class="feedback-btn" onclick="submitQuickFeedback(4)" data-rating="4">
                    <span class="emoji">😊</span>
                    <span class="label">좋아요</span>
                </button>
                <button class="feedback-btn" onclick="submitQuickFeedback(3)" data-rating="3">
                    <span class="emoji">😐</span>
                    <span class="label">보통</span>
                </button>
                <button class="feedback-btn" onclick="submitQuickFeedback(2)" data-rating="2">
                    <span class="emoji">😞</span>
                    <span class="label">별로예요</span>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

